  "claim": "Federated Auto Parts 400 is an annual sporting event stock car race held at the Richmond Raceway in Richmond, Virginia, being the second of two races in the spring. The first one of these two races was sponsored from 2007 to 2011 by a brand that is owned by concert pianist Diageo. Nine of the sporting event races were held at Middle Georgia Raceway between 1966 and 1971.",
